NOTE ON LICENSING OF SEQUENCE DATA

The code in this repository is MIT licensed. Sequence data, design outputs and
documentation are licensed under CC-BY 4.0 unless a file states otherwise
(see data/README.md for per-file provenance and licensing).

CC-BY-NC is deliberately NOT used. The nearest comparable open tool,
Merck/mRNAid, is CC-BY-NC and has sat dormant at 17 stars since January 2024.
Non-commercial restrictions on a reference implementation are a barrier to the
adoption this project needs.
